      <description>Under the Canopy of God’s Creation – CiT Outdoor Retreat Signup Here Where : Reunion Flats Campground Site B. When : Friday August 28th-Sunday August 30th: campers can check in after 2pm on the 28th, and everyone must be checked out by noon on the 30th. Shared meal : Saturday Aug 29th, 5:30PM, Nacho Bar, there will be paper sign ups to attend and bring food every Sunday at church and electronically on the CiT website, Ministry of Fun will provide paper products, water and lemonade, and set up gas camp stoves and hopefully fire in the fire ring if permitted at that time. Vespers (evening service) Saturday Aug. 29th, 7P: devotional and music to give thanks to God for all his glory and creation. Immediately following there will be a dessert contest, asking everyone to bring their best smores creations. Sunday 30th: bagels, fruit and coffee provided for those who are camping, it’s service Sunday, so those at the campground will be sent off to projects in prayer by AJ. There will be at leas</description>
